From: Phroster <6192539+Phroster@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] FFX Vulkan backend: include <mutex> for std::lock_guard

libstdc++ provides it through other headers; libc++ (Clang on Windows) does not.
---
 upstream/ffx-1.1.4/sdk/src/backends/vk/ffx_vk.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/upstream/ffx-1.1.4/sdk/src/backends/vk/ffx_vk.cpp b/upstream/ffx-1.1.4/sdk/src/backends/vk/ffx_vk.cpp
--- a/upstream/ffx-1.1.4/sdk/src/backends/vk/ffx_vk.cpp
+++ b/upstream/ffx-1.1.4/sdk/src/backends/vk/ffx_vk.cpp
@@ -26,5 +26,6 @@
 #include <FidelityFX/host/backends/vk/ffx_vk.h>
 #include <ffx_shader_blobs.h>
 #include <ffx_breadcrumbs_list.h>
+#include <mutex>

 #ifdef _WIN32
